('1b0312bd-3f61-4f6c-b238-372a482154dd', 'dba29329-9280-447f-8e06-31dd923eb04f', 'x', NULL, 'Your gems deserve the safest journey. Learn how to eliminate transit custody risk at our free workshop on Sep 14, 4 AM–9 PM, at the International Jewellery Expo Centre, Singapore. Register in bio. #TransitRisk #JadeSecurity', '[\"#TransitRisk\", \"#JadeSecurity\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Transit Custody Risk Management Workshop\", date/time \"Sep 14 | 4 AM – 9 PM\", location \"International Jewellery Expo Centre, Singapore\", high-security luxury vault with jewellery displayed, a transit truck in background, Singapore skyline, clean modern sans-serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'A 30-second promotional video for Jade by JA Assure: start with close‑up of a jewellery piece on a secure pallet, transition to a risk assessment chart, then show Jade logo and workshop details (title, date, time, location, free admission). Use a calm, authoritative voiceover, subtle professional background music, on‑screen text: \"Transit Custody Risk Management Workshop – Sep 14 | 4 AM – 9 PM – International Jewellery Expo Centre, Singapore – Free Admission – Register Now\". End with Jade logo and contact info.', 'en', '2026-09-22 07:05:14', '2026-09-22 07:05:14', 1, 1),
('1f64be4a-a47d-4698-a608-fe58045b12eb', 'ac5d9e8e-2d1b-4745-b982-a75ef74cc83d', 'reel', 'Profit Maximisation for Jewellery Businesses – 30‑Second Insight', 'Your profits are more than gold – they’re protected.', '[]', 'Your profits are more than gold – they’re protected.', '[Scene 1] Narrator: “In a world where every piece counts, hidden risks can quietly erode your profit.”\n[Scene 2] Narrator: “At Jade, we help you identify and manage those risks so you can focus on growth.”\n[Scene 3] Narrator: “Join our free webinar on Oct 7 and learn how to safeguard your margins.”\n[Scene 4] Narrator: “No guarantees, just practical insight.”\n[Scene 5] Narrator: “Register now – link in bio.”', 'Your profits are more than gold – they’re protected. In a world where every piece counts, hidden risks can quietly erode your profit. At Jade, we help you identify and manage those risks so you can focus on growth. Join our free webinar on Oct 7 and learn how to safeguard your margins. No guarantees, just practical insight. Register now – link in bio.', '[{\"scene\": 1, \"visual\": \"A close\\u2011up of a diamond under a magnifying glass, subtle jade green overlay\", \"duration\": \"4s\"}, {\"scene\": 2, \"visual\": \"Animated infographic of risk points \\u2013 theft, loss, valuation errors\", \"duration\": \"6s\"}, {\"scene\": 3, \"visual\": \"Webinar title card with date/time, virtual icon\", \"duration\": \"4s\"}, {\"scene\": 4, \"visual\": \"Text overlay: \\u2018No guarantees, just practical insight\\u2019\", \"duration\": \"3s\"}, {\"scene\": 5, \"visual\": \"Call\\u2011to\\u2011action button: \\u2018Register Now\\u2019\", \"duration\": \"3s\"}]', 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Maximising Profit for Jewellery Businesses\", date/time \"Oct 7, 2024 | 2:00 PM – 4:00 PM GMT\", location \"Virtual – Zoom\", visual scene description \"sleek, modern conference setting with subtle jewellery motifs, gold accents, high‑contrast corporate aesthetic\", clean modern typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'A short promotional video for Jade by JA Assure featuring a clean, corporate aesthetic. Opening frame: title \"Maximising Profit for Jewellery Businesses\" with date/time \"Oct 7, 2024 | 2 PM – 4 PM GMT\" and location \"Virtual – Zoom\". Mid‑section: animated infographic of risk points (theft, loss, valuation errors) over a subtle gold‑accented background. Closing frame: call‑to‑action \"Register now\" with a QR code linking to the registration page. All text in clean modern sans‑serif typography, high contrast, and corporate branding consistent with Jade’s aesthetic.', 'en', '2026-09-22 19:11:20', '2026-09-22 19:11:20', 1, 1),
('20bb9cb8-44be-45e2-92fc-820cedef3469', '5e21e31a-16f1-4768-84ef-e13c5eff7f9c', 'blog', 'Consignment & Exhibition Risk: An Underwriter Perspective for ASEAN Jewellers', 'Executive Summary: Why High-Value Retail Demands Institutional Governance\n\nWhen fine jewellery leaves permanent vault custody for international exhibitions or private collector viewings, traditional commercial policies often exhibit critical coverage gaps.\n\nSection 1: The Anatomy of Custody Handover Vulnerabilities\nHistorical loss analysis demonstrates that over 60% of claim disputes arise from mismatched transit schedules. When courier handoffs lack dual-signoff protocols, operators bear uninsurable exposures.\n\nSection 2: The Jade Underwriting Framework\nAt JA Assure, our approach combines specialized underwriting with proactive risk mitigation advisory, ensuring that your balance sheet remains insulated against volatility.\n\nConclusion: Schedule an institutional exposure review with our specialist committee.', '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Commercial advertising poster with bold typography text overlay for Jade by JA Assure. Large prominent headline text overlay across the top reads: \"JADE VAULT AUDIT 2026\". Secondary sub-headline text overlay reads: \"OCT 15 | MARINA BAY SINGAPORE\". Third line text reads: \"COMPLIMENTARY EXECUTIVE BRIEFING\". High-contrast luxury graphic design poster layout with clean typography text overlay on an editorial photograph of a high-security titanium vault with sparkling emeralds and diamond necklaces.', 'Cinematic vertical 9:16 shot of an armoured courier in elegant black uniform locking a biometric titanium transit case, moving steadily through a private gallery corridor, professional high-end lighting, seamless slow motion', 'en', '2026-09-22 07:28:40', '2026-09-22 07:28:40', 1, 1),
