('2c371cd6-55dc-4181-8aa3-af9df6239d50', 'c1b2c074-db24-4aa5-af75-7e9df9e18d78', 'reel', '45-Second Audit: The Blind Spots in Jewellery Transit', 'Most jewellers only discover their insurance exclusions after an exhibition transit loss.', '[]', 'Most jewellers only discover their insurance exclusions after an exhibition transit loss.', 'Standard commercial insurance often excludes off-premises viewings and multi-carrier handovers. Jade structures bespoke jewellers block protection built around how you actually operate.', 'Don\'t let policy exclusions blindside your atelier. Speak with Jade by JA Assure.', '[{\"scene\": 1, \"visual\": \"Close-up of a locked Pelican transit case with tamper seal\", \"duration\": \"0-10s\"}, {\"scene\": 2, \"visual\": \"Showroom floor private viewing room handover\", \"duration\": \"10-25s\"}, {\"scene\": 3, \"visual\": \"Underwriter reviewing policy schedules on digital tablet\", \"duration\": \"25-35s\"}, {\"scene\": 4, \"visual\": \"Jade logo with consultation call to action\", \"duration\": \"35-45s\"}]', 'Commercial advertising poster with bold typography text overlay for Jade by JA Assure. Large prominent headline text overlay across the top reads: \"JADE VAULT AUDIT 2026\". Secondary sub-headline text overlay reads: \"OCT 15 | MARINA BAY SINGAPORE\". Third line text reads: \"COMPLIMENTARY EXECUTIVE BRIEFING\". High-contrast luxury graphic design poster layout with clean typography text overlay on an editorial photograph of a high-security titanium vault with sparkling emeralds and diamond necklaces.', 'Cinematic vertical 9:16 shot of an armoured courier in elegant black uniform locking a biometric titanium transit case, moving steadily through a private gallery corridor, professional high-end lighting, seamless slow motion', 'en', '2026-09-22 07:50:26', '2026-09-22 07:50:26', 1, 1),
