he workshop invitation with title, date, time, location, and registration URL, concluding with the Jade logo and tagline. The video uses a warm color palette, clean transitions, and a professional voiceover that explains risk awareness and invites viewers to register. The final frame includes a call‑to‑action: \"Register at jade.com/events\".', 'en', '2026-09-22 18:09:47', '2026-09-22 18:09:47', 1, 1),
