('46214961-c27b-4459-b9a2-7ae9b53fb2a9', 'b47983f0-6c8b-4e8b-a74c-9ff843eb8b7e', 'reel', 'Secure Your Gems on the Road: Webinar Invitation', 'Did you know that 70% of high‑value items are compromised during transit to exhibitions?', '[]', 'Did you know that 70% of high‑value items are compromised during transit to exhibitions?', 'Scene 1: A jewellery display on a truck, voiceover: ‘High‑value jewellery is often exposed during transport.’\nScene 2: Close‑up of a lockbox and GPS tracker, voiceover: ‘Protecting your assets starts with understanding the risks.’\nScene 3: Webinar details on screen, voiceover: ‘Join Jade Assure’s free webinar on Oct 15 to learn how to mitigate these risks.’\nScene 4: Call‑to‑action button: ‘Register Now’', 'High‑value assets face transit risk. Learn to mitigate in our free webinar. Oct 15, 2 PM – 4 PM UTC. Register in bio.', '[{\"scene\": 1, \"visual\": \"A sleek jewellery display on a transit truck, morning light, subtle motion\", \"duration\": \"5s\"}, {\"scene\": 2, \"visual\": \"Close\\u2011up of a lockbox and GPS tracker, overlay icons of shield and map\", \"duration\": \"8s\"}, {\"scene\": 3, \"visual\": \"Webinar details with date, time, Zoom link, Jade logo\", \"duration\": \"7s\"}, {\"scene\": 4, \"visual\": \"Call\\u2011to\\u2011action button with link\", \"duration\": \"5s\"}]', 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Transit Custody Risk Management for Jewellery Exhibitions\", date/time \"Oct 15, 2024 | 2:00 PM – 4:00 PM UTC\", location \"Virtual Webinar (Zoom)\", a stylised illustration of a jewellery display on a transit truck with a secure lockbox and GPS tracker overlay, clean modern sans-serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'Create a 30‑second promotional video for Jade’s free webinar on transit custody risk. Start with a scene of a jewellery display on a transit truck, transition to a lockbox and GPS tracker, overlay webinar details (title, date, time, virtual format, free registration). Include a concise voiceover explaining the importance of understanding transit risk and the benefits of attending. End with a clear call‑to‑action button: \"Register Now\". Use clean corporate visuals, muted colour palette, and professional narration.', 'en', '2026-09-22 10:04:06', '2026-09-22 10:04:06', 1, 1),
('47e74d7f-ba92-45bf-9234-4563b7677e09', 'c146f671-5657-4bc4-b9d5-0230de9e72c1', 'blog', 'How Jewellery Businesses Can Safeguard Assets During Regional Exhibitions', 'When high‑value jewellery and fine‑art pieces move across borders for regional exhibitions, transit custody risk becomes a critical concern. This article explores the nature of these risks, how risk‑education can empower owners, and the role of specialist underwriting in creating a partnership that mitigates exposure.\n\n1. Understanding Transit Custody Risk\n   • Physical loss or damage during transport\n   • Theft or fraud in transit\n   • Regulatory compliance across jurisdictions\n\n2. The Role of Risk Education\n   • Identifying vulnerability points in the supply chain\n   • Implementing best‑practice procedures for packaging, documentation, and tracking\n   • Building a culture of risk awareness within the organisation\n\n3. Partnering with Jade by JA Assure\n   • Tailored underwriting that reflects the specific needs of jewellery and fine‑art businesses\n   • Continuous risk assessment and advisory support\n   • Transparent terms that outline responsibilities without guaranteeing zero loss\n\n4. Next Steps\n   • Attend our free webinar on Oct 15 to dive deeper into these topics\n   • Engage with our team to assess your current risk posture\n   • Explore how Jade’s partnership model can be integrated into your exhibition strategy\n\nBy combining rigorous risk‑education with specialist underwriting, jewellery businesses can move confidently through regional exhibitions, knowing that their assets are supported by a partnership designed to understand and mitigate transit custody risk.\n\nRegister now for our free webinar and take the first step towards informed risk management.', '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Transit Custody Risk Mitigation Workshop\", date/time \"Oct 15, 2026 | 10:00 AM – 12:00 PM GMT+8\", location \"Virtual – via JA Assure platform\", free admission, high-security shipping container visual, clean modern sans-serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'A short promotional video script for Jade by JA Assure: opening with a jeweller carefully packaging a necklace, voiceover about transit custody risk, cut to a secure shipping container, show Jade logo over a vault backdrop, call to action to register for the free webinar, clean corporate style, 30 seconds, high-resolution visuals.', 'en', '2026-09-22 18:24:22', '2026-09-22 18:24:22', 1, 1),
('4b9a703a-a88b-4871-afee-b3e438c4508a', '4ac07521-1b32-4f9e-a60e-afecf4a6ce52', 'linkedin', 'How to Navigate Medical Council Inquiries with Confidence', 'Specialist doctors, clinic medical directors, and general practitioners – your clinic’s resilience starts with a clear understanding of Medical Council inquiry processes and robust clinical incident protocols. Join us on 15 Oct 2024 for a free, in‑person workshop at MedTech Hub, Singapore, where we’ll walk you through step‑by‑step strategies, case studies, and practical tools to safeguard your practice. Secure your spot today: www.doctorshield.com/events. #MedicalCouncil #ClinicCompliance #DoctorShield #SingaporeHealth', '[\"#MedicalCouncil\", \"#ClinicCompliance\", \"#DoctorShield\", \"#SingaporeHealth\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'en', '2026-09-22 06:41:58', '2026-09-22 06:41:58', 1, 1),
('4ec52eb0-177c-4585-8523-9ba2bc81b5b8', '3cb539ff-5993-4fc0-ad9d-18d3e2d4a7fe', 'reel', 'Protect Your Collection – Risk Insights', 'Did you know that 70% of jewellery losses are due to unanticipated events?', '[]', 'Did you know that 70% of jewellery losses are due to unanticipated events?', 'Scene 1: Close‑up of a jeweller handling a precious gem. Voiceover: \'Every gem holds value, but also risk.\' Scene 2: Graph of loss statistics. Voiceover: \'Understanding the risks is the first step.\' Scene 3: Jade logo with webinar details. Voiceover: \'Join our free webinar on Oct 15 to learn how a specialist partnership can help you protect your assets.\' Scene 4: CTA to register. Voiceover: \'Reserve Your Spot – Free Webinar.\'', 'Every gem holds value, but also risk. Understanding the risks is the first step. Join our free webinar on Oct 15. Reserve Your Spot – Free Webinar.', '[{\"scene\": 1, \"visual\": \"Close\\u2011up of jeweller handling a gem\", \"duration\": \"5s\"}, {\"scene\": 2, \"visual\": \"Graph showing risk statistics\", \"duration\": \"7s\"}, {\"scene\": 3, \"visual\": \"Jade logo and webinar details\", \"duration\": \"8s\"}, {\"scene\": 4, \"visual\": \"Call to action with registration link\", \"duration\": \"10s\"}]', 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Jade Risk Protection Webinar: Protecting Your Precious Collections\", date/time \"Oct 15, 2024 | 3:00 PM – 4:30 PM GMT\", location \"Online – Virtual Conference\", elegant image of a jeweller beside a secure vault, clean modern sans-serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'Create a 30‑second promotional video for the Jade Risk Protection Webinar. Start with a close‑up of a jeweller handling a gem, transition to a graph showing risk statistics, overlay text: \'Protect Your Collection\', include Jade logo and webinar details (Oct 15, 3:00 PM – 4:30 PM GMT, Online). End with a call‑to‑action: \'Reserve Your Spot – Free Webinar\'. Use a sophisticated, muted colour palette, professional voiceover with authoritative tone, and crisp text overlays.', 'en', '2026-09-22 18:05:42', '2026-09-22 18:05:42', 1, 1),
('52082315-b135-442b-a8e8-9ac544f59771', 'ac5d9e8e-2d1b-4745-b982-a75ef74cc83d', 'linkedin', 'How Jewellery Businesses Can Maximise Profit – A Risk‑Aware Approach', 'In the high‑stakes world of jewellery, profit is often squeezed by hidden risks – theft, loss, valuation errors and market volatility. At Jade, we help you understand these threats and build a partnership that protects your assets while keeping your margins intact. Join our free virtual session on Oct 7 to learn how a specialist risk‑management framework can support your growth strategy without making hyperbolic guarantees. \n\nWe’ll cover:\n• Identifying the most costly risks for jewellery and fine‑art portfolios\n• How tailored insurance and security solutions can reduce exposure\n• Practical steps to integrate risk awareness into daily operations\n\nRegister today and start safeguarding your profitability with a trusted partner.', '[\"#JewelleryRisk\", \"#AssetProtection\", \"#JadeAssure\", \"#ProfitMaximisation\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Maximising Profit for Jewellery Businesses\", date/time \"Oct 7, 2024 | 2:00 PM – 4:00 PM GMT\", location \"Virtual – Zoom\", visual scene description \"sleek, modern conference setting with subtle jewellery motifs, gold accents, high‑contrast corporate aesthetic\", clean modern typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'A short promotional video for Jade by JA Assure featuring a clean, corporate aesthetic. Opening frame: title \"Maximising Profit for Jewellery Businesses\" with date/time \"Oct 7, 2024 | 2 PM – 4 PM GMT\" and location \"Virtual – Zoom\". Mid‑section: animated infographic of risk points (theft, loss, valuation errors) over a subtle gold‑accented background. Closing frame: call‑to‑action \"Register now\" with a QR code linking to the registration page. All text in clean modern sans‑serif typography, high contrast, and corporate branding consistent with Jade’s aesthetic.', 'en', '2026-09-22 19:11:20', '2026-09-22 19:11:20', 1, 1),
('57fb861a-8fcb-48ab-8638-33e4a36a64cc', '4ac07521-1b32-4f9e-a60e-afecf4a6ce52', 'instagram', NULL, 'Your clinic’s resilience starts with knowledge. Join us on 15 Oct for a free workshop on Medical Council inquiry defense and clinical incident protocols. Secure your spot now: www.doctorshield.com/events #DoctorShield #ClinicCompliance #SingaporeHealth', '[\"#DoctorShield\", \"#ClinicCompliance\", \"#SingaporeHealth\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Professional poster with calm blue palette, headline \"Medical Council Inquiry Defense & Clinical Incident Protocols Workshop\", date/time \"15 Oct 2024 | 10 AM – 4 PM\", location \"MedTech Hub, Singapore\", brand tagline \"DoctorShield by JA Assure\", clean modern sans‑serif typography, high‑contrast text, subtle background of a conference room with a doctor presenting.', NULL, NULL, 'en', '2026-09-22 06:41:58', '2026-09-22 06:41:58', 1, 1),
('5d001d4c-c14b-4c22-85e7-eb08fab6e882', 'c1b2c074-db24-4aa5-af75-7e9df9e18d78', 'blog', 'Consignment & Exhibition Risk: An Underwriter Perspective for ASEAN Jewellers', 'Executive Summary: Why High-Value Retail Demands Institutional Governance\n\nWhen fine jewellery leaves permanent vault custody for international exhibitions or private collector viewings, traditional commercial policies often exhibit critical coverage gaps.\n\nSection 1: The Anatomy of Custody Handover Vulnerabilities\nHistorical loss analysis demonstrates that over 60% of claim disputes arise from mismatched transit schedules. When courier handoffs lack dual-signoff protocols, operators bear uninsurable exposures.\n\nSection 2: The Jade Underwriting Framework\nAt JA Assure, our approach combines specialized underwriting with proactive risk mitigation advisory, ensuring that your balance sheet remains insulated against volatility.\n\nConclusion: Schedule an institutional exposure review with our specialist committee.', '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Commercial advertising poster with bold typography text overlay for Jade by JA Assure. Large prominent headline text overlay across the top reads: \"JADE VAULT AUDIT 2026\". Secondary sub-headline text overlay reads: \"OCT 15 | MARINA BAY SINGAPORE\". Third line text reads: \"COMPLIMENTARY EXECUTIVE BRIEFING\". High-contrast luxury graphic design poster layout with clean typography text overlay on an editorial photograph of a high-security titanium vault with sparkling emeralds and diamond necklaces.', 'Cinematic vertical 9:16 shot of an armoured courier in elegant black uniform locking a biometric titanium transit case, moving steadily through a private gallery corridor, professional high-end lighting, seamless slow motion', 'en', '2026-09-22 07:50:26', '2026-09-22 07:50:26', 1, 1),
('5ee58a9a-2b40-4bf5-9444-4daba256ad53', 'c1e3ad37-8984-4fef-ae0a-009727001fe6', 'blog', 'How Jewellery Businesses Can Eliminate Transit Custody Risk During Regional Exhibitions', 'Regional exhibitions are a double‑edged sword for jewellery and fine‑art businesses. The exposure to a larger audience can drive sales, but the transit of high‑value items introduces a spectrum of risks – theft, loss, damage, and even regulatory complications. Jade’s Transitional Custody Risk Masterclass, scheduled for Oct 12 2026 at the Dubai International Convention Centre, is designed to equip asset owners with a practical, evidence‑based framework for risk assessment and mitigation.\n\n## The Reality of Transit Custody\nTransit custody refers to the period when items are in the hands of transporters, couriers, or temporary storage facilities before they reach the exhibition venue. During this phase, the chain of custody can be broken, leading to loss of control over the assets. Even the most secure transport arrangements cannot guarantee zero loss; the goal is to understand and manage the risk.\n\n## What the Masterclass Covers\n1. **Transit Risk Audit** – Learn to map your specific logistics chain, identify potential weak points, and quantify exposure.\n2. **Partner Selection** – Evaluate transport providers based on track record, insurance coverage, and security protocols.\n3. **Documentation & Audit** – Implement checklists and audit trails that track each handoff, ensuring accountability.\n4. **Contractual Controls** – Draft clauses that clearly define responsibilities, indemnities, and remedial actions.\n5. **Post‑Transit Review** – Conduct a debrief to capture lessons learned and refine future processes.\n\n## Why Jade?\nJade’s expertise lies in risk‑education rather than selling promises of foolproof protection. We partner with you to build a resilient strategy that acknowledges inherent uncertainties while providing structured safeguards.\n\n## Take the Next Step\nRegister for the free masterclass on Oct 12 2026. Secure your seat and start building a partnership that empowers you to manage transit custody risk with confidence, not certainty.\n\n---\n\n*For more resources on asset protection, visit our website or contact our risk specialists.*', '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'en', '2026-09-22 07:43:38', '2026-09-22 07:43:38', 1, 1);
INSERT INTO `campaign_platform_content` (`id`, `campaign_id`, `platform`, `title`, `content`, `hashtags`, `hook`, `script`, `captions`, `visual_concept`, `image_generation_prompt`, `video_generation_prompt`, `language`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `version`, `is_current`) VALUES
('6025ae5e-b855-4681-816b-12ce99f401f1', '7a90d326-ce6e-487f-9f00-ee8dbcf2c4da', 'linkedin', 'Expert Insights: Protecting Your Jewellery Collection from Unforeseen Risks', 'In the high‑stakes world of fine jewellery, understanding the nuances of risk is as essential as the pieces themselves. Join Jade’s specialist webinar on Oct 15 to explore how tailored risk assessments, expert underwriting, and continuous partnership can help you navigate theft, loss, and market volatility. This session is designed for jewellery professionals who seek a deeper understanding of their protection strategy without the promise of guaranteed outcomes—only a clearer, data‑driven perspective. Secure your place today and start the conversation that safeguards your assets.', '[\"#JewelleryRisk\", \"#RiskManagement\", \"#JadeAssure\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Specialist Jewellery Risk Protection Webinar\", date/time \"Oct 15, 2024 | 2:00 PM – 3:30 PM GMT\", location \"Online – Webinar\", visual scene description: a stylised diamond against a muted metallic gradient background, clean modern sans‑serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'Create a 30‑second promotional video for the Specialist Jewellery Risk Protection Webinar. Opening with a close‑up of a diamond, transition to quick cuts of theft, fire, and market decline. Include Jade logo and risk icons. Overlay text: \"Specialist Jewellery Risk Protection Webinar | Oct 15, 2024 | 2:00 PM – 3:30 PM GMT | Online – Webinar | Free | Register Now\". Voiceover script: \"Every jewel tells a story, but behind the sparkle lies risk. Theft, fire, market volatility—these are real threats. At Jade, we partner with jewellers to understand these risks and craft tailored solutions—no guarantees, just informed protection. Join our free webinar on Oct 15. Secure your future, one informed decision at a time.\" End with a call‑to‑action button \"Register Now\" and Jade branding. Use a sophisticated, muted color palette with subtle gold accents. Ensure clear, crisp visuals and smooth transitions. Render in high definition.', 'en', '2026-09-22 18:07:01', '2026-09-22 18:07:01', 1, 1),
('602aa3d4-1774-4fd4-bde1-c5382c41f269', 'c1e3ad37-8984-4fef-ae0a-009727001fe6', 'reel', 'Mastering Transit Custody Risk for Jewelers', 'Ever wondered how to protect your gems during regional shows? Let’s break it down in 60 seconds.', '[]', 'Ever wondered how to protect your gems during regional shows? Let’s break it down in 60 seconds.', '[Scene 1] (0-5s) – Close‑up of a jewellery display at an exhibition. Voiceover: “Your collection’s journey to an exhibition starts with transit custody.”\n[Scene 2] (5-12s) – Animation of a shipping container moving across a map. Voiceover: “From warehouse to venue, each handoff is a risk point.”\n[Scene 3] (12-20s) – Split screen: left side shows a checklist; right side shows a secure transport vehicle. Voiceover: “A transit risk audit, secure partners, and clear documentation can turn uncertainty into manageable risk.”\n[Scene 4] (20-30s) – Jade logo with event details overlay. Voiceover: “Join Jade’s masterclass on Oct 12 in Dubai and learn the framework that protects your assets.”\n[Scene 5] (30-35s) – Call‑to‑action button animation: “Register Now – Free Admission.” Voiceover: “Reserve your seat today.”', NULL, '[{\"scene\": 1, \"visual\": \"Close\\u2011up of a jewellery display at an exhibition\", \"duration\": \"0-5s\"}]', NULL, NULL, 'en', '2026-09-22 07:43:38', '2026-09-22 07:43:38', 1, 1),
('6b228457-3cee-48f4-aa2f-35624e630726', 'acd2df96-4d04-4ae2-9cc8-f58e4d9f9ee0', 'x', NULL, 'ASEAN exhibition season is in full swing. Are you prepared for multi‑custody transport? Join Jade’s seminar on Oct 15 to learn risk‑aware strategies. Free admission. #JadeRiskProtection #ASEANExhibitions', '[\"#JadeRiskProtection\", \"#ASEANExhibitions\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"ASEAN Jewellery Transport Security Seminar\", date/time \"Oct 15, 2024 | 10:00 AM – 4:00 PM\", location \"Singapore Expo Hall B\", free admission, high‑security vault with luxury jewellery display, ASEAN flag backdrop, clean modern sans-serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'A 30‑second promotional video showing a master jeweller packaging a necklace, a secure transport van, a Jade vault at destination, Jade logo, event details overlay, voiceover explaining risk‑aware partnership, call to action to register at jade.com.', 'en', '2026-09-22 08:40:52', '2026-09-22 08:40:52', 1, 1),
('6b9b63cd-2f44-4f6c-a6d4-fa2effc56c2a', '3cb539ff-5993-4fc0-ad9d-18d3e2d4a7fe', 'linkedin', 'Are You Prepared for the Unseen Risks in Jewellery?', 'Jewellery businesses face a complex risk landscape—from theft and loss to market volatility and regulatory changes. At Jade, we specialise in understanding these nuances and providing tailored risk solutions. Join our free webinar on Oct 15 to learn how a partnership with a specialist insurer can help you mitigate uncertainty and protect your assets.', '[\"#JewelleryRisk\", \"#RiskManagement\", \"#JadeAssure\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Jade Risk Protection Webinar: Protecting Your Precious Collections\", date/time \"Oct 15, 2024 | 3:00 PM – 4:30 PM GMT\", location \"Online – Virtual Conference\", elegant image of a jeweller beside a secure vault, clean modern sans-serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'Create a 30‑second promotional video for the Jade Risk Protection Webinar. Start with a close‑up of a jeweller handling a gem, transition to a graph showing risk statistics, overlay text: \'Protect Your Collection\', include Jade logo and webinar details (Oct 15, 3:00 PM – 4:30 PM GMT, Online). End with a call‑to‑action: \'Reserve Your Spot – Free Webinar\'. Use a sophisticated, muted colour palette, professional voiceover with authoritative tone, and crisp text overlays.', 'en', '2026-09-22 18:05:42', '2026-09-22 18:05:42', 1, 1),
('6c30dd1a-e30f-407e-9a79-fdf05bf9ab1a', 'b47983f0-6c8b-4e8b-a74c-9ff843eb8b7e', 'instagram', NULL, 'Exhibiting your jewels? Don’t let transit risk tarnish your showcase. Join our free webinar on Oct 15 to learn how to protect your high‑value assets from departure to return. Register in bio. #JewelleryRisk #ExhibitionSecurity #JadeAssure', '[\"#JewelleryRisk\", \"#ExhibitionSecurity\", \"#JadeAssure\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A sleek poster featuring a stylised jewellery display on a transit truck, overlaid with Jade logo and webinar details, clean sans‑serif typography, corporate aesthetic, high‑contrast text', 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Transit Custody Risk Management for Jewellery Exhibitions\", date/time \"Oct 15, 2024 | 2:00 PM – 4:00 PM UTC\", location \"Virtual Webinar (Zoom)\", a stylised illustration of a jewellery display on a transit truck with a secure lockbox and GPS tracker overlay, clean modern sans-serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'Create a 30‑second promotional video for Jade’s free webinar on transit custody risk. Start with a scene of a jewellery display on a transit truck, transition to a lockbox and GPS tracker, overlay webinar details (title, date, time, virtual format, free registration). Include a concise voiceover explaining the importance of understanding transit risk and the benefits of attending. End with a clear call‑to‑action button: \"Register Now\". Use clean corporate visuals, muted colour palette, and professional narration.', 'en', '2026-09-22 10:04:06', '2026-09-22 10:04:06', 1, 1),
('6e5cefa7-5d69-4150-a8d5-59da191e2740', 'acd2df96-4d04-4ae2-9cc8-f58e4d9f9ee0', 'reel', 'Transporting Treasure Safely in ASEAN', 'Ever wondered how to keep your jewels safe when moving across multiple custodians?', '[]', 'Ever wondered how to keep your jewels safe when moving across multiple custodians?', 'Scene 1: A master jeweller carefully packages a delicate necklace in a padded case. Scene 2: A secure transport van, branded with Jade, loads the case into a climate‑controlled compartment. Scene 3: At the destination, a Jade vault receives the case, and a technician verifies the seal. Voiceover: \"At Jade, we help you understand the risks, design robust protocols, and partner with you for secure transport. Join our free seminar on Oct 15 at Singapore Expo Hall B. Secure your knowledge, safeguard your assets.\"', 'Learn more at jade.com', '[{\"scene\": 1, \"visual\": \"Master jeweller packaging a necklace in a padded case\", \"duration\": \"5s\"}, {\"scene\": 2, \"visual\": \"Secure transport van loading the case into climate\\u2011controlled compartment\", \"duration\": \"7s\"}, {\"scene\": 3, \"visual\": \"Jade vault receiving the case, technician verifying seal\", \"duration\": \"8s\"}]', 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"ASEAN Jewellery Transport Security Seminar\", date/time \"Oct 15, 2024 | 10:00 AM – 4:00 PM\", location \"Singapore Expo Hall B\", free admission, high‑security vault with luxury jewellery display, ASEAN flag backdrop, clean modern sans-serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'A 30‑second promotional video showing a master jeweller packaging a necklace, a secure transport van, a Jade vault at destination, Jade logo, event details overlay, voiceover explaining risk‑aware partnership, call to action to register at jade.com.', 'en', '2026-09-22 08:40:52', '2026-09-22 08:40:52', 1, 1),
('6e6f8285-18ef-4ed8-b398-b2695c576e01', '9007a646-1ad3-48ed-b3fd-3512cd6e36e0', 'instagram', NULL, 'Join us on Sep 25 for a deep dive into protecting your most valuable assets. No guarantees, just expert partnership. Register at jade.com/events #JadeAssure #LuxuryProtection', '[\"#JewelleryRisk\", \"#AssetProtection\", \"#JadeAssure\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Elegant, minimalist poster featuring the Jade logo, workshop title, date/time, location, and clean typography. Background of subtle jewel silhouettes and a faint security icon, high‑contrast text, corporate aesthetic', 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Safeguarding Your Jewelry: Risk Management Workshop\", date/time \"Sep 25, 10 AM – 4 PM\", location \"Jade Conference Centre, London\", a subtle silhouette of a jeweler with sparkling gems and a faint security lock icon, clean modern sans‑serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'A short promotional video (30‑seconds) that opens with a close‑up of a jeweler’s shop, transitions to an animated risk matrix, then displays the workshop invitation with title, date, time, location, and registration URL, concluding with the Jade logo and tagline. The video uses a warm color palette, clean transitions, and a professional voiceover that explains risk awareness and invites viewers to register. The final frame includes a call‑to‑action: \"Register at jade.com/events\".', 'en', '2026-09-22 18:09:47', '2026-09-22 18:09:47', 1, 1),
('6f9c6185-f401-4287-a53a-1a1671985909', 'ac5d9e8e-2d1b-4745-b982-a75ef74cc83d', 'instagram', NULL, '🔒 Protect your profits, not just your pieces. Join Jade’s free webinar Oct 7 to learn how risk‑aware strategies keep your margins strong. Register in bio. #JewelleryRisk #AssetProtection', '[\"#JewelleryRisk\", \"#AssetProtection\", \"#JadeAssure\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A sleek poster featuring jade green accents, subtle gold lines, and a stylised diamond silhouette. The headline ‘Maximising Profit for Jewellery Businesses’ sits centered at the top, with date/time and location in a lower banner. Clean modern sans‑serif typography, high contrast, corporate aesthetic.', 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Maximising Profit for Jewellery Businesses\", date/time \"Oct 7, 2024 | 2:00 PM – 4:00 PM GMT\", location \"Virtual – Zoom\", visual scene description \"sleek, modern conference setting with subtle jewellery motifs, gold accents, high‑contrast corporate aesthetic\", clean modern typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'A short promotional video for Jade by JA Assure featuring a clean, corporate aesthetic. Opening frame: title \"Maximising Profit for Jewellery Businesses\" with date/time \"Oct 7, 2024 | 2 PM – 4 PM GMT\" and location \"Virtual – Zoom\". Mid‑section: animated infographic of risk points (theft, loss, valuation errors) over a subtle gold‑accented background. Closing frame: call‑to‑action \"Register now\" with a QR code linking to the registration page. All text in clean modern sans‑serif typography, high contrast, and corporate branding consistent with Jade’s aesthetic.', 'en', '2026-09-22 19:11:20', '2026-09-22 19:11:20', 1, 1),
('77889e22-5e3a-4329-8ba6-012bddaad159', 'c146f671-5657-4bc4-b9d5-0230de9e72c1', 'x', NULL, 'Worried about transit custody risk during exhibitions? Join our free webinar on Oct 15 to learn risk‑education strategies and underwriting partnership models. No guarantees, just informed risk management. Register now: https://jaassure.com/jade-webinar #JewelleryRisk #ExhibitionSecurity', '[\"#JewelleryRisk\", \"#ExhibitionSecurity\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Transit Custody Risk Mitigation Workshop\", date/time \"Oct 15, 2026 | 10:00 AM – 12:00 PM GMT+8\", location \"Virtual – via JA Assure platform\", free admission, high-security shipping container visual, clean modern sans-serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'A short promotional video script for Jade by JA Assure: opening with a jeweller carefully packaging a necklace, voiceover about transit custody risk, cut to a secure shipping container, show Jade logo over a vault backdrop, call to action to register for the free webinar, clean corporate style, 30 seconds, high-resolution visuals.', 'en', '2026-09-22 18:24:22', '2026-09-22 18:24:22', 1, 1),
('7ab76522-9c55-4343-8550-f8771c9a5302', '7a24048a-e1e3-4bb0-ab1f-806490435f27', 'x', NULL, 'Exhibiting jewellery? Understand transit custody risk and learn how to mitigate it. Join our free webinar on Sep 26, 10 AM–9 PM at London Exhibition Centre. Register now – spots limited. #JewelleryRisk #ExhibitionSecurity', '[\"#JewelleryRisk\", \"#ExhibitionSecurity\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Transit Custody Risk Webinar\", date/time \"Sep 26 | 10 AM – 9 PM\", location \"London Exhibition Centre\", luxury jewellery pieces in secure transit packaging displayed in a high‑end exhibition hall, clean modern sans‑serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'A short corporate video for Jade by JA Assure featuring a narrator explaining transit custody risk, showing jewellery in transit, risk assessment charts, and a CTA to register for the webinar. Clean corporate aesthetic, high contrast, professional. ', 'en', '2026-09-22 10:31:47', '2026-09-22 10:31:47', 1, 1),
('7b3f5d3b-4650-4d2b-bcfa-fb975d9c3cc7', '9007a646-1ad3-48ed-b3fd-3512cd6e36e0', 'blog', 'How to Safeguard Your Jewelry: A Comprehensive Guide', 'High‑value jewelry, fine art and other luxury assets are prized for their beauty and rarity, but they also come with a set of unique risks. Theft, loss, damage, and even market volatility can threaten the value of these assets. The best protection strategy is a combination of risk awareness, preventive measures, and a partnership with a specialist insurer.\n\n1. Understand the Threat Landscape\n   • Identify the most common risks: burglary, accidental damage, loss in transit, natural disasters, and market fluctuations.\n   • Conduct a risk assessment specific to your inventory: age, provenance, and storage conditions.\n\n2. Implement Preventive Controls\n   • Secure storage: climate‑controlled vaults, tamper‑evident seals, and real‑time monitoring.\n   • Inventory management: detailed records, regular audits, and segregation of high‑risk items.\n   • Employee training: security protocols, handling procedures, and emergency response.\n\n3. Choose the Right Coverage\n   • Work with a specialist like Jade to tailor a policy that reflects your specific risk profile.\n   • Understand the limits, exclusions, and endorsements that apply to jewelry and fine art.\n   • Regularly review and adjust coverage as your inventory and risk environment evolve.\n\n4. Build a Partnership, Not a Transaction\n   • Engage in ongoing dialogue with your insurer.\n   • Leverage risk‑management advice and loss prevention resources.\n   • Use data from claims and industry insights to refine your protective measures.\n\nBy combining thorough risk education with expert underwriting, you can protect your assets without relying on unrealistic guarantees. Register for our upcoming workshop on Sep 25 to deepen your understanding and strengthen your partnership with Jade.\n', '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Safeguarding Your Jewelry: Risk Management Workshop\", date/time \"Sep 25, 10 AM – 4 PM\", location \"Jade Conference Centre, London\", a subtle silhouette of a jeweler with sparkling gems and a faint security lock icon, clean modern sans‑serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'A short promotional video (30‑seconds) that opens with a close‑up of a jeweler’s shop, transitions to an animated risk matrix, then displays the workshop invitation with title, date, time, location, and registration URL, concluding with the Jade logo and tagline. The video uses a warm color palette, clean transitions, and a professional voiceover that explains risk awareness and invites viewers to register. The final frame includes a call‑to‑action: \"Register at jade.com/events\".', 'en', '2026-09-22 18:09:47', '2026-09-22 18:09:47', 1, 1),
('7ea5e42c-6a18-41f6-8b24-f2a2ff651d15', 'c1b2c074-db24-4aa5-af75-7e9df9e18d78', 'instagram', NULL, 'Behind every exquisite collection lies an uncompromised chain of custody.\n\nAt Jade by JA Assure, our specialist underwriters design bespoke protection for fine art and jewellery businesses that demand institutional rigor.\n\nSwipe to explore the 4 vulnerabilities luxury ateliers encounter during peak exhibition seasons.', '[\"#JadeInsurance\", \"#FineJewellery\", \"#Gemmology\", \"#VaultSecurity\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Editorial macro photograph of a master gemmologist inspecting a rare Colombian emerald inside a brushed steel vault, warm ambient lighting with dark green accents.', 'Commercial advertising poster with bold typography text overlay for Jade by JA Assure. Large prominent headline text overlay across the top reads: \"JADE VAULT AUDIT 2026\". Secondary sub-headline text overlay reads: \"OCT 15 | MARINA BAY SINGAPORE\". Third line text reads: \"COMPLIMENTARY EXECUTIVE BRIEFING\". High-contrast luxury graphic design poster layout with clean typography text overlay on an editorial photograph of a high-security titanium vault with sparkling emeralds and diamond necklaces.', 'Cinematic vertical 9:16 shot of an armoured courier in elegant black uniform locking a biometric titanium transit case, moving steadily through a private gallery corridor, professional high-end lighting, seamless slow motion', 'en', '2026-09-22 07:50:26', '2026-09-22 07:50:26', 1, 1),
