('87f3771c-e491-4cd8-a373-91077f4c37a3', '7a24048a-e1e3-4bb0-ab1f-806490435f27', 'instagram', NULL, 'Exhibiting jewellery? Don’t let transit custody risk compromise your assets. Join our free webinar on Sept 26, 10 AM–9 PM at London Exhibition Centre to learn how to secure your pieces. Register now – spots are limited! #JewelleryRisk #ExhibitionSecurity #JAAssure', '[\"#JewelleryRisk\", \"#ExhibitionSecurity\", \"#JAAssure\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Elegant event poster featuring a luxury jewellery display, secure transit packaging, and a high‑end exhibition hall backdrop.', 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Transit Custody Risk Webinar\", date/time \"Sep 26 | 10 AM – 9 PM\", location \"London Exhibition Centre\", luxury jewellery pieces in secure transit packaging displayed in a high‑end exhibition hall, clean modern sans‑serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'A short corporate video for Jade by JA Assure featuring a narrator explaining transit custody risk, showing jewellery in transit, risk assessment charts, and a CTA to register for the webinar. Clean corporate aesthetic, high contrast, professional. ', 'en', '2026-09-22 10:31:47', '2026-09-22 10:31:47', 1, 1),
('918d133a-9a3e-40cb-bf1b-6e2d6582c47a', 'ec1ccb12-abde-40f1-a316-0dec519d26b0', 'linkedin', 'Eliminating Transit Custody Risk for Your Exhibition Pieces', 'As a jewellery or fine‑art business, the risk of loss or damage during transit to regional exhibitions can impact your reputation and bottom line. At Jade, we specialise in risk education and underwriting partnership. Join our free workshop on Oct 15, 2024 to understand the key factors in transit custody risk, how to assess your exposure, and best practices for securing your high‑value assets. Register now to secure your spot.', '[\"#JewellerySecurity\", \"#FineArtProtection\", \"#TransitRisk\", \"#JadeAssure\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Transit Custody Risk Management Workshop\", date/time \"Oct 15, 2024 | 9 AM – 4 PM\", location \"Marina Bay Sands, Singapore\", a high-security exhibition environment with jewellery displays and a secure shipping container, clean modern typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'Create a 30‑second promotional video for Jade’s Transit Custody Risk Management Workshop. The video should open with a dynamic shot of an exhibition hall, transition to a security expert inside a secure shipping container, showcase secure packaging and real‑time tracking technology, and end with event details overlay: title \"Transit Custody Risk Management Workshop\", date \"Oct 15, 2024\", time \"9 AM – 4 PM\", location \"Marina Bay Sands, Singapore\", and call to action \"Register Now – Free Admission\". Use corporate aesthetic, clean typography, and subtitles. The tone should be authoritative, educational, and risk‑aware, avoiding any guarantee of protection. Include a voiceover script that matches the reel script above.', 'en', '2026-09-22 08:56:25', '2026-09-22 08:56:25', 1, 1),
('91bd047a-c577-4b9e-bac6-832ce2e0517f', 'acd2df96-4d04-4ae2-9cc8-f58e4d9f9ee0', 'instagram', NULL, 'Master jewellers & collectors, protect your jewels during ASEAN exhibitions. Join our free seminar on Oct 15 to learn how to navigate multi‑custody transport safely. #JadeRiskProtection #FineJewellery #ASEANExhibitions', '[\"#JadeRiskProtection\", \"#FineJewellery\", \"#ASEANExhibitions\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Elegant, minimalist poster with Jade logo, event title, date/time, location, free admission, clean sans-serif typography', 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"ASEAN Jewellery Transport Security Seminar\", date/time \"Oct 15, 2024 | 10:00 AM – 4:00 PM\", location \"Singapore Expo Hall B\", free admission, high‑security vault with luxury jewellery display, ASEAN flag backdrop, clean modern sans-serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'A 30‑second promotional video showing a master jeweller packaging a necklace, a secure transport van, a Jade vault at destination, Jade logo, event details overlay, voiceover explaining risk‑aware partnership, call to action to register at jade.com.', 'en', '2026-09-22 08:40:52', '2026-09-22 08:40:52', 1, 1),
