('97277382-ee72-4b36-a642-96d48ca3ae05', '7a90d326-ce6e-487f-9f00-ee8dbcf2c4da', 'instagram', NULL, 'Every precious piece deserves a protective strategy as robust as its craftsmanship. On Oct 15, Jade invites you to a focused webinar on specialist jewellery risk protection. Discover how a partnership with an expert insurer can deepen your understanding of risk without making impossible promises. Reserve your free spot now—link in bio. #JewelleryRisk #RiskManagement #JadeAssure', '[\"#JewelleryRisk\", \"#RiskManagement\", \"#JadeAssure\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A sleek, minimalist graphic featuring a stylised diamond silhouette against a subtle metallic gradient. Overlaid in bold sans‑serif: \"Specialist Jewellery Risk Protection Webinar\". Below, the date/time and location in smaller font. The brand logo appears in the bottom corner. The overall tone is sophisticated and risk‑educational, with muted gold accents.', 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Specialist Jewellery Risk Protection Webinar\", date/time \"Oct 15, 2024 | 2:00 PM – 3:30 PM GMT\", location \"Online – Webinar\", visual scene description: a stylised diamond against a muted metallic gradient background, clean modern sans‑serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'Create a 30‑second promotional video for the Specialist Jewellery Risk Protection Webinar. Opening with a close‑up of a diamond, transition to quick cuts of theft, fire, and market decline. Include Jade logo and risk icons. Overlay text: \"Specialist Jewellery Risk Protection Webinar | Oct 15, 2024 | 2:00 PM – 3:30 PM GMT | Online – Webinar | Free | Register Now\". Voiceover script: \"Every jewel tells a story, but behind the sparkle lies risk. Theft, fire, market volatility—these are real threats. At Jade, we partner with jewellers to understand these risks and craft tailored solutions—no guarantees, just informed protection. Join our free webinar on Oct 15. Secure your future, one informed decision at a time.\" End with a call‑to‑action button \"Register Now\" and Jade branding. Use a sophisticated, muted color palette with subtle gold accents. Ensure clear, crisp visuals and smooth transitions. Render in high definition.', 'en', '2026-09-22 18:07:01', '2026-09-22 18:07:01', 1, 1),
('99a92680-e559-41ea-8343-f5e752d6ae1a', 'b47983f0-6c8b-4e8b-a74c-9ff843eb8b7e', 'blog', 'Managing Transit Custody Risk in Regional Jewellery Exhibitions: Insights from Jade Assure', 'Regional exhibitions offer unparalleled exposure for jewellers, fine‑art businesses and luxury asset owners. Yet the very act of transporting precious items across borders introduces a host of risks—physical loss, theft, damage, and regulatory compliance challenges. This article outlines the most common transit threats, explains how to conduct a comprehensive risk assessment, and details practical steps you can take to reduce exposure.\n\n1. Identify the Asset Profile\n2. Map the Transit Route and Identify Vulnerabilities\n3. Select Appropriate Security Measures (e.g., tamper‑evident packaging, real‑time tracking)\n4. Work with an Underwriting Partner to Structure Coverage\n5. Post‑Transit Audit and Documentation\n\nBy partnering with a specialist insurer like Jade Assure, you gain access to industry expertise, tailored coverage solutions, and an underwriting team that understands the nuances of high‑value asset protection.\n\nRead on to learn how to protect your most valuable assets during the journey to and from your next exhibition.', '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Transit Custody Risk Management for Jewellery Exhibitions\", date/time \"Oct 15, 2024 | 2:00 PM – 4:00 PM UTC\", location \"Virtual Webinar (Zoom)\", a stylised illustration of a jewellery display on a transit truck with a secure lockbox and GPS tracker overlay, clean modern sans-serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'Create a 30‑second promotional video for Jade’s free webinar on transit custody risk. Start with a scene of a jewellery display on a transit truck, transition to a lockbox and GPS tracker, overlay webinar details (title, date, time, virtual format, free registration). Include a concise voiceover explaining the importance of understanding transit risk and the benefits of attending. End with a clear call‑to‑action button: \"Register Now\". Use clean corporate visuals, muted colour palette, and professional narration.', 'en', '2026-09-22 10:04:06', '2026-09-22 10:04:06', 1, 1),
