 a calm, authoritative voiceover, subtle professional background music, on‑screen text: \"Transit Custody Risk Management Workshop – Sep 14 | 4 AM – 9 PM – International Jewellery Expo Centre, Singapore – Free Admission – Register Now\". End with Jade logo and contact info.', 'en', '2026-09-22 07:05:14', '2026-09-22 07:05:14', 1, 1),
