('a4a754a5-57a2-4485-8d26-7e90663cdb67', '638382c0-180c-4db3-9e58-27384681c1c6', 'reel', 'Secure Your Collection During Exhibitions', 'Did you know that transit custody risk can cost you thousands?', '[]', 'Did you know that transit custody risk can cost you thousands?', '[Scene 1] Close‑up of a dazzling jewellery display. Voiceover: “Your pieces are your legacy.” [Scene 2] Graphic of a transit route with a red warning icon. Voiceover: “Transit custody risk is real.” [Scene 3] Jade logo with event details. Voiceover: “Join Jade’s free session on Sep 20 to learn how to eliminate that risk.” [Scene 4] Call‑to‑action button: “Register Now.” Voiceover: “Secure your spot today.”', 'Secure your collection during exhibitions. Join Jade’s free session on Sep 20. Register now.', '[{\"scene\": 1, \"visual\": \"Close\\u2011up of a jewellery display on a reflective surface\", \"duration\": \"5s\"}, {\"scene\": 2, \"visual\": \"Animated transit route with a red warning icon\", \"duration\": \"4s\"}, {\"scene\": 3, \"visual\": \"Jade logo with event title, date, time, and location overlay\", \"duration\": \"5s\"}, {\"scene\": 4, \"visual\": \"Call\\u2011to\\u2011action button \\\"Register Now\\\" with subtle motion\", \"duration\": \"3s\"}]', 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Transit Custody Risk Mitigation for Jewellery Exhibitions\", date/time \"Sep 20 | 10 AM – 7 PM\", location \"Global Exhibition Hub, Singapore\", luxurious jewellery display beside a subtle secure vault illustration, muted gold accents, clean modern sans-serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'Create a short promotional video for Jade by JA Assure. The video should open with a close‑up of a jewellery showcase, transition to a graphic of a secure transit route, overlay the event title \"Transit Custody Risk Mitigation for Jewellery Exhibitions\", date/time \"Sep 20 | 10 AM – 7 PM\", location \"Global Exhibition Hub, Singapore\", include a call‑to‑action button \"Register Now\", maintain a sophisticated, institutional tone, use muted gold and charcoal palette, high‑resolution, cinematic pacing.', 'en', '2026-09-22 15:53:18', '2026-09-22 15:53:18', 1, 1),
('a6bb6ef8-0db4-4fee-9186-ef5eb6452df4', '7a24048a-e1e3-4bb0-ab1f-806490435f27', 'reel', 'Transit Custody Risk: A Quick Guide for Jewellery Exhibitors', 'Do you know how to protect your jewellery during exhibitions?', '[]', 'Do you know how to protect your jewellery during exhibitions?', '[Scene 1] Close‑up of a precious necklace on a display stand. Voiceover: \"Exhibiting jewellery is thrilling, but it also exposes your pieces to transit custody risk.\"\n[Scene 2] A courier loading the necklace into a secure, tamper‑evident package. Voiceover: \"Secure packaging is the first line of defense.\"\n[Scene 3] A digital map showing the transit route with checkpoints. Voiceover: \"Every leg of the journey matters – from customs to transport to the venue.\"\n[Scene 4] A Jade specialist reviewing a risk assessment document. Voiceover: \"Partner with Jade to understand and mitigate those risks.\"\n[Scene 5] The event poster with details. Voiceover: \"Join our free webinar on Sept 26, 10 AM–9 PM at London Exhibition Centre. Register now.\"\n[End]', 'Do you know how to protect your jewellery during exhibitions? Join our free webinar on Sept 26 to learn how. Register now.', '[{\"scene\": 1, \"visual\": \"Close\\u2011up of a precious necklace on a display stand\", \"duration\": \"3s\"}, {\"scene\": 2, \"visual\": \"Courier placing the necklace into a tamper\\u2011evident package\", \"duration\": \"4s\"}, {\"scene\": 3, \"visual\": \"Digital map with transit route and checkpoints\", \"duration\": \"5s\"}, {\"scene\": 4, \"visual\": \"Jade specialist reviewing a risk assessment document\", \"duration\": \"4s\"}, {\"scene\": 5, \"visual\": \"Event poster with webinar details\", \"duration\": \"3s\"}]', 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Transit Custody Risk Webinar\", date/time \"Sep 26 | 10 AM – 9 PM\", location \"London Exhibition Centre\", luxury jewellery pieces in secure transit packaging displayed in a high‑end exhibition hall, clean modern sans‑serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'A short corporate video for Jade by JA Assure featuring a narrator explaining transit custody risk, showing jewellery in transit, risk assessment charts, and a CTA to register for the webinar. Clean corporate aesthetic, high contrast, professional. ', 'en', '2026-09-22 10:31:47', '2026-09-22 10:31:47', 1, 1),
('aa394b38-4b5e-4cca-8116-87cbaa244dc5', '7a24048a-e1e3-4bb0-ab1f-806490435f27', 'linkedin', 'Safeguarding Jewellery Exhibitions: Minimising Transit Custody Risk', 'Exhibiting jewellery or fine art across regions exposes assets to transit custody risk. In our upcoming webinar, we’ll break down the key risk factors, show how to assess and mitigate them, and outline the partnership approach Jade offers to help you navigate this complex terrain. Join industry peers on Sept 26 to gain actionable insights and strengthen your protection strategy.\n\nRegister now to secure your spot.\n\n#JewelleryRisk #ExhibitionSecurity #JAAssure', '[\"#JewelleryRisk\", \"#ExhibitionSecurity\", \"#JAAssure\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Transit Custody Risk Webinar\", date/time \"Sep 26 | 10 AM – 9 PM\", location \"London Exhibition Centre\", luxury jewellery pieces in secure transit packaging displayed in a high‑end exhibition hall, clean modern sans‑serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'A short corporate video for Jade by JA Assure featuring a narrator explaining transit custody risk, showing jewellery in transit, risk assessment charts, and a CTA to register for the webinar. Clean corporate aesthetic, high contrast, professional. ', 'en', '2026-09-22 10:31:47', '2026-09-22 10:31:47', 1, 1),
('ad392b90-239b-40a8-bba0-79dd03a2e217', '638382c0-180c-4db3-9e58-27384681c1c6', 'linkedin', 'How to Protect Your Jewellery Collection During Exhibitions', 'Regional exhibitions are a prime opportunity to showcase your pieces, but they also present transit custody challenges. Join Jade’s expert session on Sep 20 and learn proven strategies to minimise risk while maintaining operational efficiency. This educational event is tailored for jewellers, fine‑art businesses, and luxury asset owners who demand the highest level of protection. Secure your place – registration is free.', '[\"#JewelleryRisk\", \"#AssetProtection\", \"#ExhibitionSecurity\", \"#JAAssure\", \"#Jade\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Transit Custody Risk Mitigation for Jewellery Exhibitions\", date/time \"Sep 20 | 10 AM – 7 PM\", location \"Global Exhibition Hub, Singapore\", luxurious jewellery display beside a subtle secure vault illustration, muted gold accents, clean modern sans-serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'Create a short promotional video for Jade by JA Assure. The video should open with a close‑up of a jewellery showcase, transition to a graphic of a secure transit route, overlay the event title \"Transit Custody Risk Mitigation for Jewellery Exhibitions\", date/time \"Sep 20 | 10 AM – 7 PM\", location \"Global Exhibition Hub, Singapore\", include a call‑to‑action button \"Register Now\", maintain a sophisticated, institutional tone, use muted gold and charcoal palette, high‑resolution, cinematic pacing.', 'en', '2026-09-22 15:53:18', '2026-09-22 15:53:18', 1, 1),
('b02fac21-78c6-4ed1-a5ee-7b9361defde8', 'ac5d9e8e-2d1b-4745-b982-a75ef74cc83d', 'blog', 'Maximising Profit in the Jewellery Industry: Risk‑Management Insights', 'The jewellery industry thrives on precision, quality and trust. Yet the very factors that elevate value – precious metals, gemstones, fine‑art pieces – also expose businesses to significant risks. From theft and loss to valuation errors and market swings, hidden threats can erode profit margins over time.\n\nAt Jade, we recognise that protecting assets is not merely about insurance premiums; it’s about building a partnership that understands the nuances of your business. Our approach is grounded in risk education and tailored solutions:\n\n1. **Risk Identification** – We map the specific threats that affect jewellery and fine‑art portfolios, from shop‑lifting to supply‑chain disruptions.\n2. **Strategic Coverage** – We design insurance and security packages that align with your risk profile, ensuring coverage where it matters most.\n3. **Operational Integration** – We provide practical tools and training to embed risk awareness into daily workflows, reducing the likelihood of loss and the associated financial impact.\n\nBy adopting a risk‑aware mindset, you can safeguard your assets and, consequently, your profitability. Our free webinar on Oct 7 offers a deep dive into these concepts, with no guarantees of profit but a clear roadmap to protect and optimise your margins.\n\n**Register today** and start the conversation with a partner who understands the intricacies of the jewellery market.\n', '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Maximising Profit for Jewellery Businesses\", date/time \"Oct 7, 2024 | 2:00 PM – 4:00 PM GMT\", location \"Virtual – Zoom\", visual scene description \"sleek, modern conference setting with subtle jewellery motifs, gold accents, high‑contrast corporate aesthetic\", clean modern typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'A short promotional video for Jade by JA Assure featuring a clean, corporate aesthetic. Opening frame: title \"Maximising Profit for Jewellery Businesses\" with date/time \"Oct 7, 2024 | 2 PM – 4 PM GMT\" and location \"Virtual – Zoom\". Mid‑section: animated infographic of risk points (theft, loss, valuation errors) over a subtle gold‑accented background. Closing frame: call‑to‑action \"Register now\" with a QR code linking to the registration page. All text in clean modern sans‑serif typography, high contrast, and corporate branding consistent with Jade’s aesthetic.', 'en', '2026-09-22 19:11:20', '2026-09-22 19:11:20', 1, 1);
