('b295bf4e-4879-4739-8bde-c41038c1e6eb', 'c1e3ad37-8984-4fef-ae0a-009727001fe6', 'instagram', NULL, '📍Dubai International Convention Centre • 📅 Oct 12 2026 • ⏰ 10 AM – 4 PM\n\nJade invites jewellers, fine‑art firms and luxury asset owners to a risk‑education masterclass focused on transit custody during regional exhibitions. In a single day you’ll walk through:\n• Transit risk audits\n• Secure transport partnerships\n• Documentation & audit of custody chains\n• Contractual risk controls\n\nThis isn’t a sales pitch – it’s a partnership in understanding and managing risk. Secure your free seat now.\n\n#RiskManagement #JadeAssure #LuxuryAssets', '[\"#RiskManagement\", \"#JadeAssure\", \"#LuxuryAssets\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A sleek, high‑contrast event poster with Jade’s logo, title in bold, date/time, location, and free admission banner. Clean modern sans‑serif typography, subtle gold accents, and a background image of a secure transit corridor.', NULL, NULL, 'en', '2026-09-22 07:43:38', '2026-09-22 07:43:38', 1, 1),
('ba4ba31e-02d1-4bbb-8cd8-8017b972ea5a', '7a90d326-ce6e-487f-9f00-ee8dbcf2c4da', 'x', NULL, '🔒 Join Jade’s Specialist Jewellery Risk Protection Webinar on Oct 15, 2‑3:30 PM GMT. Learn how expert risk assessment and partnership can help you navigate theft, loss, and market volatility—without guarantees, just insight. Register now: https://jadeassure.com/webinar', '[\"#JewelleryRisk\", \"#RiskManagement\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Specialist Jewellery Risk Protection Webinar\", date/time \"Oct 15, 2024 | 2:00 PM – 3:30 PM GMT\", location \"Online – Webinar\", visual scene description: a stylised diamond against a muted metallic gradient background, clean modern sans‑serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'Create a 30‑second promotional video for the Specialist Jewellery Risk Protection Webinar. Opening with a close‑up of a diamond, transition to quick cuts of theft, fire, and market decline. Include Jade logo and risk icons. Overlay text: \"Specialist Jewellery Risk Protection Webinar | Oct 15, 2024 | 2:00 PM – 3:30 PM GMT | Online – Webinar | Free | Register Now\". Voiceover script: \"Every jewel tells a story, but behind the sparkle lies risk. Theft, fire, market volatility—these are real threats. At Jade, we partner with jewellers to understand these risks and craft tailored solutions—no guarantees, just informed protection. Join our free webinar on Oct 15. Secure your future, one informed decision at a time.\" End with a call‑to‑action button \"Register Now\" and Jade branding. Use a sophisticated, muted color palette with subtle gold accents. Ensure clear, crisp visuals and smooth transitions. Render in high definition.', 'en', '2026-09-22 18:07:01', '2026-09-22 18:07:01', 1, 1),
('bf229b66-dc0a-49ae-b1c2-55170e168380', 'dba29329-9280-447f-8e06-31dd923eb04f', 'blog', 'Eliminating Transit Custody Risk for Jewellery Businesses During Regional Exhibitions', 'Regional exhibitions are pivotal for brand exposure but also expose jewellery businesses to significant transit custody risk. This article explores the key challenges—unauthorised access, theft, loss during transport, and the lack of real‑time monitoring. It then outlines practical steps to mitigate these risks, including secure packaging, real‑time tracking, insurance alignment, and partnership with a specialist underwriter. Jade by JA Assure offers a tailored risk‑understanding framework and a free workshop on Sep 14 to help you safeguard your assets. Register now to join industry peers and gain insights that protect your reputation and bottom line.', '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Transit Custody Risk Management Workshop\", date/time \"Sep 14 | 4 AM – 9 PM\", location \"International Jewellery Expo Centre, Singapore\", high-security luxury vault with jewellery displayed, a transit truck in background, Singapore skyline, clean modern sans-serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'A 30-second promotional video for Jade by JA Assure: start with close‑up of a jewellery piece on a secure pallet, transition to a risk assessment chart, then show Jade logo and workshop details (title, date, time, location, free admission). Use a calm, authoritative voiceover, subtle professional background music, on‑screen text: \"Transit Custody Risk Management Workshop – Sep 14 | 4 AM – 9 PM – International Jewellery Expo Centre, Singapore – Free Admission – Register Now\". End with Jade logo and contact info.', 'en', '2026-09-22 07:05:14', '2026-09-22 07:05:14', 1, 1),
('c024453e-e8ac-4485-a0ae-f39788fcb4da', 'c146f671-5657-4bc4-b9d5-0230de9e72c1', 'linkedin', 'Eliminate Transit Custody Risk at Exhibitions – A Risk‑Education Webinar', 'Jewellery and fine‑art businesses face unique challenges when transporting high‑value assets for regional exhibitions. Join us on Oct 15 for a 2‑hour webinar where JA Assure’s Jade team will walk you through the key risks, risk‑understanding frameworks, and underwriting partnership models that help you manage transit custody risk effectively. No guarantees, only informed risk management. Secure your spot now: https://jaassure.com/jade-webinar', '[\"#JewelleryRisk\", \"#ExhibitionSecurity\", \"#JAAssure\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Transit Custody Risk Mitigation Workshop\", date/time \"Oct 15, 2026 | 10:00 AM – 12:00 PM GMT+8\", location \"Virtual – via JA Assure platform\", free admission, high-security shipping container visual, clean modern sans-serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'A short promotional video script for Jade by JA Assure: opening with a jeweller carefully packaging a necklace, voiceover about transit custody risk, cut to a secure shipping container, show Jade logo over a vault backdrop, call to action to register for the free webinar, clean corporate style, 30 seconds, high-resolution visuals.', 'en', '2026-09-22 18:24:22', '2026-09-22 18:24:22', 1, 1),
('cbe91473-deb0-4efd-ac3b-a59e39c03bf5', 'ac5d9e8e-2d1b-4745-b982-a75ef74cc83d', 'x', NULL, 'Your profits are more than gold – they’re protected by smart risk management. Join Jade’s free webinar on Oct 7 to learn how to safeguard your assets and optimise margins. No promises, just practical insight. Register now. https://jadeassure.com/register', '[\"#JewelleryRisk\", \"#AssetProtection\", \"#JadeAssure\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Maximising Profit for Jewellery Businesses\", date/time \"Oct 7, 2024 | 2:00 PM – 4:00 PM GMT\", location \"Virtual – Zoom\", visual scene description \"sleek, modern conference setting with subtle jewellery motifs, gold accents, high‑contrast corporate aesthetic\", clean modern typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'A short promotional video for Jade by JA Assure featuring a clean, corporate aesthetic. Opening frame: title \"Maximising Profit for Jewellery Businesses\" with date/time \"Oct 7, 2024 | 2 PM – 4 PM GMT\" and location \"Virtual – Zoom\". Mid‑section: animated infographic of risk points (theft, loss, valuation errors) over a subtle gold‑accented background. Closing frame: call‑to‑action \"Register now\" with a QR code linking to the registration page. All text in clean modern sans‑serif typography, high contrast, and corporate branding consistent with Jade’s aesthetic.', 'en', '2026-09-22 19:11:20', '2026-09-22 19:11:20', 1, 1),
('cd852fe6-8087-434e-9056-ba0353358090', 'acd2df96-4d04-4ae2-9cc8-f58e4d9f9ee0', 'linkedin', 'Secure Your Collection: Multi‑Custody Transport for ASEAN Exhibitions', 'During the bustling ASEAN exhibition seasons, master jewellers and private collectors face unique challenges in moving precious assets across multiple custodians. Jade offers a partnership‑based approach that helps you understand the risks, design robust transport protocols, and maintain compliance without overpromising protection. Join us for an in‑person seminar where industry experts will walk you through best practices, risk assessment tools, and the latest regulatory insights. Secure your knowledge, safeguard your assets.', '[\"#JadeRiskProtection\", \"#ASEANExhibitions\", \"#FineJewellery\", \"#TransportSecurity\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"ASEAN Jewellery Transport Security Seminar\", date/time \"Oct 15, 2024 | 10:00 AM – 4:00 PM\", location \"Singapore Expo Hall B\", free admission, high‑security vault with luxury jewellery display, ASEAN flag backdrop, clean modern sans-serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'A 30‑second promotional video showing a master jeweller packaging a necklace, a secure transport van, a Jade vault at destination, Jade logo, event details overlay, voiceover explaining risk‑aware partnership, call to action to register at jade.com.', 'en', '2026-09-22 08:40:52', '2026-09-22 08:40:52', 1, 1),
('d0625ae1-6267-48d5-b36c-aadd92d470e5', 'ec1ccb12-abde-40f1-a316-0dec519d26b0', 'instagram', NULL, 'Your jewels deserve the best protection on the road. Join us for a deep dive into transit custody risk management at regional exhibitions. Secure your spot now. #JadeAssure #JewellerySecurity #FineArtProtection', '[\"#JewellerySecurity\", \"#FineArtProtection\", \"#TransitRisk\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A sleek poster featuring an exhibition hall with jewellery displays, a secure shipping container, and the event details overlayed with clean typography', 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Transit Custody Risk Management Workshop\", date/time \"Oct 15, 2024 | 9 AM – 4 PM\", location \"Marina Bay Sands, Singapore\", a high-security exhibition environment with jewellery displays and a secure shipping container, clean modern typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'Create a 30‑second promotional video for Jade’s Transit Custody Risk Management Workshop. The video should open with a dynamic shot of an exhibition hall, transition to a security expert inside a secure shipping container, showcase secure packaging and real‑time tracking technology, and end with event details overlay: title \"Transit Custody Risk Management Workshop\", date \"Oct 15, 2024\", time \"9 AM – 4 PM\", location \"Marina Bay Sands, Singapore\", and call to action \"Register Now – Free Admission\". Use corporate aesthetic, clean typography, and subtitles. The tone should be authoritative, educational, and risk‑aware, avoiding any guarantee of protection. Include a voiceover script that matches the reel script above.', 'en', '2026-09-22 08:56:25', '2026-09-22 08:56:25', 1, 1),
('d3930ec1-ca10-46db-bcbf-791c73db20d6', '7a90d326-ce6e-487f-9f00-ee8dbcf2c4da', 'reel', 'Risk Management for Jewellery: What You Need to Know', 'Ever wondered why some jewellers never face loss? It’s not luck—it’s risk education.', '[]', 'Ever wondered why some jewellers never face loss? It’s not luck—it’s risk education.', 'Scene 1: Close‑up of a gleaming diamond. Voiceover: \"Every jewel tells a story, but behind the sparkle lies risk.\" Scene 2: Quick montage of theft, fire, market drop. Voiceover: \"Theft, fire, market volatility—these are real threats.\" Scene 3: Jade logo appears. Voiceover: \"At Jade, we partner with jewellers to understand these risks and craft tailored solutions—no guarantees, just informed protection.\" Scene 4: Invitation text: \"Join our free webinar on Oct 15. Register now.\" Voiceover: \"Secure your future, one informed decision at a time.\"', 'Risk is real. Knowledge is protection. Join our free webinar Oct 15.', '[{\"scene\": 1, \"visual\": \"Close\\u2011up of a diamond on a velvet cushion, slow motion sparkle\", \"duration\": \"5s\"}, {\"scene\": 2, \"visual\": \"Rapid cuts of a burglary scene, a fire alarm, a declining graph\", \"duration\": \"8s\"}, {\"scene\": 3, \"visual\": \"Jade logo with a subtle metallic sheen, overlay of risk icons\", \"duration\": \"7s\"}, {\"scene\": 4, \"visual\": \"Webinar invitation graphic with date, time, and registration link\", \"duration\": \"5s\"}]', 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Specialist Jewellery Risk Protection Webinar\", date/time \"Oct 15, 2024 | 2:00 PM – 3:30 PM GMT\", location \"Online – Webinar\", visual scene description: a stylised diamond against a muted metallic gradient background, clean modern sans‑serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'Create a 30‑second promotional video for the Specialist Jewellery Risk Protection Webinar. Opening with a close‑up of a diamond, transition to quick cuts of theft, fire, and market decline. Include Jade logo and risk icons. Overlay text: \"Specialist Jewellery Risk Protection Webinar | Oct 15, 2024 | 2:00 PM – 3:30 PM GMT | Online – Webinar | Free | Register Now\". Voiceover script: \"Every jewel tells a story, but behind the sparkle lies risk. Theft, fire, market volatility—these are real threats. At Jade, we partner with jewellers to understand these risks and craft tailored solutions—no guarantees, just informed protection. Join our free webinar on Oct 15. Secure your future, one informed decision at a time.\" End with a call‑to‑action button \"Register Now\" and Jade branding. Use a sophisticated, muted color palette with subtle gold accents. Ensure clear, crisp visuals and smooth transitions. Render in high definition.', 'en', '2026-09-22 18:07:01', '2026-09-22 18:07:01', 1, 1),
('d599a93d-47b4-4f3a-9645-19b57342b9b2', '5e21e31a-16f1-4768-84ef-e13c5eff7f9c', 'instagram', NULL, 'Behind every exquisite collection lies an uncompromised chain of custody.\n\nAt Jade by JA Assure, our specialist underwriters design bespoke protection for fine art and jewellery businesses that demand institutional rigor.\n\nSwipe to explore the 4 vulnerabilities luxury ateliers encounter during peak exhibition seasons.', '[\"#JadeInsurance\", \"#FineJewellery\", \"#Gemmology\", \"#VaultSecurity\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Editorial macro photograph of a master gemmologist inspecting a rare Colombian emerald inside a brushed steel vault, warm ambient lighting with dark green accents.', 'Commercial advertising poster with bold typography text overlay for Jade by JA Assure. Large prominent headline text overlay across the top reads: \"JADE VAULT AUDIT 2026\". Secondary sub-headline text overlay reads: \"OCT 15 | MARINA BAY SINGAPORE\". Third line text reads: \"COMPLIMENTARY EXECUTIVE BRIEFING\". High-contrast luxury graphic design poster layout with clean typography text overlay on an editorial photograph of a high-security titanium vault with sparkling emeralds and diamond necklaces.', 'Cinematic vertical 9:16 shot of an armoured courier in elegant black uniform locking a biometric titanium transit case, moving steadily through a private gallery corridor, professional high-end lighting, seamless slow motion', 'en', '2026-09-22 07:28:40', '2026-09-22 07:28:40', 1, 1),
('d5a56538-af6d-4e5a-a95c-912a2d0d7979', '4ac07521-1b32-4f9e-a60e-afecf4a6ce52', 'blog', 'Preparing Your Clinic for Medical Council Inquiries: Key Protocols & Strategies', 'In the fast‑paced world of healthcare, a Medical Council inquiry can arise unexpectedly. Understanding the inquiry process, documenting clinical incidents, and having a clear response plan are essential to protecting your clinic’s reputation and ensuring patient safety.\n\n**1. Understanding Medical Council Inquiries**\nThe Medical Council investigates concerns about professional conduct or clinical standards. Knowing the triggers, timelines, and documentation requirements helps you respond promptly and accurately.\n\n**2. Clinical Incident Protocols**\nA robust incident reporting system, clear escalation pathways, and regular training sessions empower staff to manage incidents effectively and reduce risk.\n\n**3. Workshop Highlights**\nOn 15 Oct 2024, DoctorShield will host a free, in‑person workshop at MedTech Hub, Singapore. Topics include:\n- Step‑by‑step guide to responding to an inquiry\n- Practical case studies\n- Building an incident management framework\n- Q&A with legal and clinical experts\n\n**4. Why Attend?**\n- Gain confidence in handling inquiries\n- Learn evidence‑based incident protocols\n- Network with peers and experts\n- Receive a comprehensive resource kit\n\n**5. Register Today**\nSecure your spot now at www.doctorshield.com/events. The workshop is free, but spaces are limited. Don’t miss this opportunity to strengthen your clinic’s resilience.\n\n*Prepared by DoctorShield – Your trusted partner in medical indemnity and professional protection.*', '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'en', '2026-09-22 06:41:58', '2026-09-22 06:41:58', 1, 1),
('d7ed5740-4033-47a6-bf5d-37fde1d56ac2', 'c146f671-5657-4bc4-b9d5-0230de9e72c1', 'reel', 'Transit Custody Risk? We’ve Got You Covered', 'Are you worried about your precious pieces during exhibitions?', '[]', 'Are you worried about your precious pieces during exhibitions?', '[Scene 1] A jeweller carefully placing a necklace in a case. Voiceover: \"Transporting high‑value jewellery for exhibitions is risky. \n[Scene 2] A secure shipping container on a truck. Voiceover: \"Transit custody risk can lead to loss or damage. \n[Scene 3] A Jade logo with a secure vault backdrop. Voiceover: \"Jade by JA Assure partners with you to understand and mitigate that risk. \n[Scene 4] Call to action: \"Join our free webinar on Oct 15. Register link in bio.\"', 'Register for our free webinar on Oct 15 – link in bio.', '[{\"scene\": 1, \"visual\": \"Jeweller placing a necklace in a protective case\", \"duration\": \"5s\"}, {\"scene\": 2, \"visual\": \"Secure shipping container on a truck\", \"duration\": \"5s\"}, {\"scene\": 3, \"visual\": \"Jade logo over a secure vault backdrop\", \"duration\": \"5s\"}, {\"scene\": 4, \"visual\": \"Text overlay: \\\"Register for free webinar Oct\\u202f15\\\"\", \"duration\": \"5s\"}]', 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Transit Custody Risk Mitigation Workshop\", date/time \"Oct 15, 2026 | 10:00 AM – 12:00 PM GMT+8\", location \"Virtual – via JA Assure platform\", free admission, high-security shipping container visual, clean modern sans-serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'A short promotional video script for Jade by JA Assure: opening with a jeweller carefully packaging a necklace, voiceover about transit custody risk, cut to a secure shipping container, show Jade logo over a vault backdrop, call to action to register for the free webinar, clean corporate style, 30 seconds, high-resolution visuals.', 'en', '2026-09-22 18:24:22', '2026-09-22 18:24:22', 1, 1),
('e14e5704-e745-4998-94c1-e1dee6bde2a6', 'ec1ccb12-abde-40f1-a316-0dec519d26b0', 'blog', 'Transit Custody Risk Management: A Guide for Jewellery and Fine Art Businesses', 'Exhibitions are a critical opportunity for showcasing high‑value pieces, but they also present a complex array of risks during transit. This guide explores the most common vulnerabilities—transport delays, handling errors, security breaches, and environmental factors—and provides a framework for assessing exposure, selecting appropriate coverage, and implementing practical safeguards. By understanding the risk landscape and working with a specialist like Jade, businesses can reduce the likelihood of loss or damage, protect their reputation, and maintain confidence among collectors and partners.', '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Transit Custody Risk Management Workshop\", date/time \"Oct 15, 2024 | 9 AM – 4 PM\", location \"Marina Bay Sands, Singapore\", a high-security exhibition environment with jewellery displays and a secure shipping container, clean modern typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'Create a 30‑second promotional video for Jade’s Transit Custody Risk Management Workshop. The video should open with a dynamic shot of an exhibition hall, transition to a security expert inside a secure shipping container, showcase secure packaging and real‑time tracking technology, and end with event details overlay: title \"Transit Custody Risk Management Workshop\", date \"Oct 15, 2024\", time \"9 AM – 4 PM\", location \"Marina Bay Sands, Singapore\", and call to action \"Register Now – Free Admission\". Use corporate aesthetic, clean typography, and subtitles. The tone should be authoritative, educational, and risk‑aware, avoiding any guarantee of protection. Include a voiceover script that matches the reel script above.', 'en', '2026-09-22 08:56:25', '2026-09-22 08:56:25', 1, 1),
('e2e44038-7f57-405e-9e50-8fd487b20c8e', 'c1e3ad37-8984-4fef-ae0a-009727001fe6', 'linkedin', 'Safeguarding Your Collection During Regional Exhibitions – A Risk Management Primer', 'When your precious pieces travel for regional shows, the risk of loss or damage is a reality you must plan for. Jade’s Transitional Custody Risk Masterclass offers a concise, evidence‑based framework for jewellers, fine‑art firms and luxury asset owners to assess, manage and mitigate transit risks. In this session you’ll learn:\n• How to conduct a transit risk audit tailored to exhibition logistics.\n• The role of secure transport partners and insurance carve‑outs.\n• Practical steps to document and audit custody chains.\n• How to embed risk controls into your exhibition contracts.\nJade’s approach is rooted in risk‑education, not guarantees. Join us to build a partnership that enhances your protection strategy, not promises foolproof outcomes.', '[\"#RiskManagement\", \"#JadeAssure\", \"#LuxuryAssets\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'en', '2026-09-22 07:43:38', '2026-09-22 07:43:38', 1, 1),
('e689c6da-0b3e-41c4-8fe4-d4238b7ab74c', '5e21e31a-16f1-4768-84ef-e13c5eff7f9c', 'x', NULL, 'High-value inventory risk isn\'t just about vault thickness—it\'s about protocol redundancy at handover points.\n\nHow does your atelier manage off-site client viewings? Read our underwriting brief: jaassure.com/jade', '[\"#JewelleryRisk\", \"#LuxurySecurity\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Commercial advertising poster with bold typography text overlay for Jade by JA Assure. Large prominent headline text overlay across the top reads: \"JADE VAULT AUDIT 2026\". Secondary sub-headline text overlay reads: \"OCT 15 | MARINA BAY SINGAPORE\". Third line text reads: \"COMPLIMENTARY EXECUTIVE BRIEFING\". High-contrast luxury graphic design poster layout with clean typography text overlay on an editorial photograph of a high-security titanium vault with sparkling emeralds and diamond necklaces.', 'Cinematic vertical 9:16 shot of an armoured courier in elegant black uniform locking a biometric titanium transit case, moving steadily through a private gallery corridor, professional high-end lighting, seamless slow motion', 'en', '2026-09-22 07:28:40', '2026-09-22 07:28:40', 1, 1),
('edcd6fbb-c02a-4e1f-a34c-5e84a1eff9ad', '7a24048a-e1e3-4bb0-ab1f-806490435f27', 'blog', 'Understanding Transit Custody Risk in Jewellery Exhibitions', 'Exhibiting high‑value jewellery and fine art across regional venues presents a unique set of challenges, particularly around transit custody risk. In this article, we explore the nature of these risks, how they can impact your business, and the best practices to mitigate them.\n\n**What is Transit Custody Risk?**\nTransit custody risk refers to the potential for loss, damage, or theft of assets while they are being transported between storage, exhibition venues, and final destinations. The risk is heightened during exhibitions because pieces often travel across borders, are handled by multiple parties, and are displayed in public spaces.\n\n**Key Risk Factors**\n1. **Multiple Handlers** – Each additional person handling the asset increases the opportunity for loss or damage.\n2. **Cross‑Border Regulations** – Varying customs and security protocols can expose assets to delays or seizure.\n3. **Transit Conditions** – Temperature, humidity, and vibration can affect delicate pieces.\n4. **Security Infrastructure** – Inadequate packaging or inadequate transport security can leave assets vulnerable.\n\n**Mitigation Strategies**\n- **Risk Assessment** – Conduct a detailed assessment of every leg of the transit journey.\n- **Secure Packaging** – Use tamper‑evident, climate‑controlled packaging designed for jewellery.\n- **Trusted Carriers** – Partner with carriers who specialise in high‑value goods and provide real‑time tracking.\n- **Insurance & Underwriting** – Work with specialists like Jade to understand coverage limits and exclusions.\n- **Contingency Planning** – Have backup plans for customs delays, transport disruptions, and emergency retrieval.\n\n**Why Partner with Jade?**\nJade offers a partnership model that focuses on risk understanding rather than blanket guarantees. By collaborating with you on risk assessment, we help you align your security measures with industry best practices and regulatory requirements.\n\n**Take Action**\nJoin our free webinar on Sept 26, 10 AM–9 PM at the London Exhibition Centre to dive deeper into these topics and learn how to protect your assets throughout the exhibition cycle. Register today to secure your place.\n\n---\nStay ahead of risk. Protect your masterpieces. ', '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Transit Custody Risk Webinar\", date/time \"Sep 26 | 10 AM – 9 PM\", location \"London Exhibition Centre\", luxury jewellery pieces in secure transit packaging displayed in a high‑end exhibition hall, clean modern sans‑serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'A short corporate video for Jade by JA Assure featuring a narrator explaining transit custody risk, showing jewellery in transit, risk assessment charts, and a CTA to register for the webinar. Clean corporate aesthetic, high contrast, professional. ', 'en', '2026-09-22 10:31:47', '2026-09-22 10:31:47', 1, 1),
('f083d332-ba9f-4cfb-a91c-5ff7ad03802c', '9007a646-1ad3-48ed-b3fd-3512cd6e36e0', 'x', NULL, 'Join us on Sep 25 from 10 AM to 4 PM at the Jade Conference Centre, London, for a workshop on risk management for luxury assets. Learn how to protect your jewelry and fine art with expert guidance. No guarantees, just informed partnership. Register: jade.com/events', '[\"#JewelleryRisk\", \"#AssetProtection\", \"#JadeAssure\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Safeguarding Your Jewelry: Risk Management Workshop\", date/time \"Sep 25, 10 AM – 4 PM\", location \"Jade Conference Centre, London\", a subtle silhouette of a jeweler with sparkling gems and a faint security lock icon, clean modern sans‑serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'A short promotional video (30‑seconds) that opens with a close‑up of a jeweler’s shop, transitions to an animated risk matrix, then displays the workshop invitation with title, date, time, location, and registration URL, concluding with the Jade logo and tagline. The video uses a warm color palette, clean transitions, and a professional voiceover that explains risk awareness and invites viewers to register. The final frame includes a call‑to‑action: \"Register at jade.com/events\".', 'en', '2026-09-22 18:09:47', '2026-09-22 18:09:47', 1, 1),
('f1aaed0d-b155-496d-bca6-a423964415db', '638382c0-180c-4db3-9e58-27384681c1c6', 'x', NULL, 'Exhibiting your jewels? Learn how to eliminate transit custody risk on Sep 20 at the Global Exhibition Hub, Singapore. Free session for jewellers & fine‑art businesses. Register now. #JewelleryRisk #ExhibitionSecurity', '[\"#JewelleryRisk\", \"#ExhibitionSecurity\", \"#JAAssure\", \"#Jade\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Transit Custody Risk Mitigation for Jewellery Exhibitions\", date/time \"Sep 20 | 10 AM – 7 PM\", location \"Global Exhibition Hub, Singapore\", luxurious jewellery display beside a subtle secure vault illustration, muted gold accents, clean modern sans-serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'Create a short promotional video for Jade by JA Assure. The video should open with a close‑up of a jewellery showcase, transition to a graphic of a secure transit route, overlay the event title \"Transit Custody Risk Mitigation for Jewellery Exhibitions\", date/time \"Sep 20 | 10 AM – 7 PM\", location \"Global Exhibition Hub, Singapore\", include a call‑to‑action button \"Register Now\", maintain a sophisticated, institutional tone, use muted gold and charcoal palette, high‑resolution, cinematic pacing.', 'en', '2026-09-22 15:53:18', '2026-09-22 15:53:18', 1, 1),
('f7345020-fc2c-4c4f-9155-2bbb80db2690', 'acd2df96-4d04-4ae2-9cc8-f58e4d9f9ee0', 'blog', 'Navigating Multi‑Custody Transport for High‑Value Jewellery During ASEAN Exhibitions', 'The ASEAN exhibition season presents a complex landscape for master jewellers and private collectors. Transporting high‑value jewellery across multiple custodians requires a nuanced understanding of risk, compliance, and logistics. Jade’s partnership model focuses on risk education, tailored transport protocols, and continuous support, ensuring that you are equipped to make informed decisions. While we do not guarantee zero loss, we provide the tools and expertise to minimise exposure and navigate the regulatory environment with confidence. Join us on Oct 15 to deepen your knowledge and strengthen your transport strategy.', '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"ASEAN Jewellery Transport Security Seminar\", date/time \"Oct 15, 2024 | 10:00 AM – 4:00 PM\", location \"Singapore Expo Hall B\", free admission, high‑security vault with luxury jewellery display, ASEAN flag backdrop, clean modern sans-serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'A 30‑second promotional video showing a master jeweller packaging a necklace, a secure transport van, a Jade vault at destination, Jade logo, event details overlay, voiceover explaining risk‑aware partnership, call to action to register at jade.com.', 'en', '2026-09-22 08:40:52', '2026-09-22 08:40:52', 1, 1),
('f9367108-02f2-42a3-8734-7d4614b50b70', 'dba29329-9280-447f-8e06-31dd923eb04f', 'linkedin', 'Eliminate Transit Custody Risk at Exhibitions – Join Our Free Workshop', 'Regional exhibitions expose jewellery businesses to transit custody risks that can impact reputation and financial performance. At Jade by JA Assure, we’re offering a complimentary workshop that demystifies these risks and provides actionable strategies. Our partnership approach focuses on risk understanding and tailored underwriting solutions. Secure your spot today and protect your most valuable assets. \n\nRegister now: [Link]', '[\"#TransitRisk\", \"#JewellerySecurity\", \"#JAAssure\", \"#Jade\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Transit Custody Risk Management Workshop\", date/time \"Sep 14 | 4 AM – 9 PM\", location \"International Jewellery Expo Centre, Singapore\", high-security luxury vault with jewellery displayed, a transit truck in background, Singapore skyline, clean modern sans-serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'A 30-second promotional video for Jade by JA Assure: start with close‑up of a jewellery piece on a secure pallet, transition to a risk assessment chart, then show Jade logo and workshop details (title, date, time, location, free admission). Use a calm, authoritative voiceover, subtle professional background music, on‑screen text: \"Transit Custody Risk Management Workshop – Sep 14 | 4 AM – 9 PM – International Jewellery Expo Centre, Singapore – Free Admission – Register Now\". End with Jade logo and contact info.', 'en', '2026-09-22 07:05:14', '2026-09-22 07:05:14', 1, 1),
('fe2c3f24-4bc8-4640-8d2d-6756702ba8a7', '4ac07521-1b32-4f9e-a60e-afecf4a6ce52', 'x', NULL, 'Specialists & clinic leaders: Join our free workshop on Medical Council inquiry defense & incident protocols. 15 Oct 2024, MedTech Hub, Singapore. Register: www.doctorshield.com/events #MedicalCouncil #SingaporeHealth', '[\"#MedicalCouncil\", \"#SingaporeHealth\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'en', '2026-09-22 06:41:58', '2026-09-22 06:41:58', 1, 1),
('fea32573-6c94-4c04-af30-aee8ccd5a93b', '5e21e31a-16f1-4768-84ef-e13c5eff7f9c', 'reel', '45-Second Audit: The Blind Spots in Jewellery Transit', 'Most jewellers only discover their insurance exclusions after an exhibition transit loss.', '[]', 'Most jewellers only discover their insurance exclusions after an exhibition transit loss.', 'Standard commercial insurance often excludes off-premises viewings and multi-carrier handovers. Jade structures bespoke jewellers block protection built around how you actually operate.', 'Don\'t let policy exclusions blindside your atelier. Speak with Jade by JA Assure.', '[{\"scene\": 1, \"visual\": \"Close-up of a locked Pelican transit case with tamper seal\", \"duration\": \"0-10s\"}, {\"scene\": 2, \"visual\": \"Showroom floor private viewing room handover\", \"duration\": \"10-25s\"}, {\"scene\": 3, \"visual\": \"Underwriter reviewing policy schedules on digital tablet\", \"duration\": \"25-35s\"}, {\"scene\": 4, \"visual\": \"Jade logo with consultation call to action\", \"duration\": \"35-45s\"}]', 'Commercial advertising poster with bold typography text overlay for Jade by JA Assure. Large prominent headline text overlay across the top reads: \"JADE VAULT AUDIT 2026\". Secondary sub-headline text overlay reads: \"OCT 15 | MARINA BAY SINGAPORE\". Third line text reads: \"COMPLIMENTARY EXECUTIVE BRIEFING\". High-contrast luxury graphic design poster layout with clean typography text overlay on an editorial photograph of a high-security titanium vault with sparkling emeralds and diamond necklaces.', 'Cinematic vertical 9:16 shot of an armoured courier in elegant black uniform locking a biometric titanium transit case, moving steadily through a private gallery corridor, professional high-end lighting, seamless slow motion', 'en', '2026-09-22 07:28:40', '2026-09-22 07:28:40', 1, 1),
('ffa313d9-948c-4fde-be10-d9a6ef53d045', '638382c0-180c-4db3-9e58-27384681c1c6', 'blog', 'Mitigating Transit Custody Risk for Jewellery Exhibitions: A Practical Guide', 'Exhibitions offer unparalleled exposure for jewellery and fine‑art businesses, yet they bring inherent transit custody risks. This guide outlines the primary threat vectors, risk assessment frameworks, and actionable mitigation strategies tailored for high‑value assets. By adopting a structured approach—leveraging secure transport partners, real‑time tracking, and comprehensive underwriting—businesses can reduce exposure while maintaining the operational tempo required for successful exhibitions. The chapter concludes with a checklist for event preparation and a call to action to engage Jade’s risk‑education resources for further support.', '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A professional event poster for Jade by JA Assure featuring the title \"Transit Custody Risk Mitigation for Jewellery Exhibitions\", date/time \"Sep 20 | 10 AM – 7 PM\", location \"Global Exhibition Hub, Singapore\", luxurious jewellery display beside a subtle secure vault illustration, muted gold accents, clean modern sans-serif typography, high contrast between text and background, crisp readable lettering, corporate aesthetic graphic design poster layout.', 'Create a short promotional video for Jade by JA Assure. The video should open with a close‑up of a jewellery showcase, transition to a graphic of a secure transit route, overlay the event title \"Transit Custody Risk Mitigation for Jewellery Exhibitions\", date/time \"Sep 20 | 10 AM – 7 PM\", location \"Global Exhibition Hub, Singapore\", include a call‑to‑action button \"Register Now\", maintain a sophisticated, institutional tone, use muted gold and charcoal palette, high‑resolution, cinematic pacing.', 'en', '2026-09-22 15:53:18', '2026-09-22 15:53:18', 1, 1);

