('02240216-cd4c-49f8-af17-71b450a4d573', '7a24048a-e1e3-4bb0-ab1f-806490435f27', 'linkedin', 'published', '6ab259d180cb27270aacc3fe', 'https://publish.buffer.com/organization/6ab21db8f343178ecdc4c6d2/queue', 'Exhibiting jewellery or fine art across regions exposes assets to transit custody risk. In our upcoming webinar, we’ll break down the key risk factors, show how to assess and mitigate them, and outline the partnership approach Jade offers to help you navigate this complex terrain. Join industry peers on Sept 26 to gain actionable insights and strengthen your protection strategy.\n\nRegister now to secure your spot.\n\n#JewelleryRisk #ExhibitionSecurity #JAAssure\n\n#JewelleryRisk #ExhibitionSecurity #JAAssure', '45180724-425b-471d-a921-f763e6422cb6', NULL, '2026-09-22 16:04:56', '2026-09-22 16:03:48', '2026-09-22 16:04:56', 'buffer', NULL),
